OL,3,GNEWSADiscounted bus fare scheme
OL,4,Aextended to 1 January
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus passengers in Lancashire will be
OL,7,Fable to get discounted fares for longer
OL,8,Fthan previously planned after the
OL,9,Finitiative was extended until after
OL,10,FChristmas.
OL,12,FThe flat #1-per-journey fare in
OL,13,Foperation during evenings and all day
OL,14,Fon Sundays across much of the county
OL,15,Fhad been due to come to an end earlier,
OL,16,Fwith prices doubling to #2.
OL,18,FBack in June, the Lancashire Combined
OL,19,FCounty Authority (LCCA) said it could
OL,20,Fno longer afford to subsidise the
OL,21,Fscheme.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
