OL,3,GNEWSADiscounted bus fare scheme
OL,4,Aextended to 1 January
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has, however, extended the offer to
OL,7,FNew Year's Eve, in line with the
OL,8,Fgovernment's decision to lower the
OL,9,Fnationwide bus fare cap from #3 to its
OL,10,Fprevious #2 level from 1 January.
